Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:05.61,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\an9\3c&000000&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:09.54,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\an9\3c&278BD3&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:03.58,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}对轻咬示好的小猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:09.40,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我们由此相视而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:15.57,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我们永远如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:18.60,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}该是多么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:21.12,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是爱意袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:24.93,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越发急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:27.70,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:28.20,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就选你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.71,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:34.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.42,0:02:36.72,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.72,0:02:39.26,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.92,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小猫轻咬般你侬我侬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:46.96,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}这么直到永远就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:50.87,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我们认真起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.51,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&A9A954&\blur4\t(300,2000,\3c&C777C3&)}心痛是在所难免的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:54.86,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.83,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\3c&579BE3&\blur4\t(0,1900,\3c&55BA79&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:02:59.28,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4\t(0,2500,\3c&C777C3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:02:59.81,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\frz-90\fn@\an4\pos(1800,404)\blur4\3c&C777C3&}而我许下愿望
